  // ── 通用「功能说明」组件 + 43-C/43-B 说明内容 ──
  "功能说明": "How it works",
  "作用": "Purpose",
  "使用步骤": "Steps",
  "要点": "Notes",
  "对历史某段日期重新跑数据加工任务(补数/回刷)。批量展开成「日期×节点」实例,自动限并发、按依赖链顺序推进、失败可只续跑失败项;补数运行与在线调度严格隔离,不污染成功率与 SLA 统计。": "Re-run data pipelines for a past date range (backfill). Expands into date×node instances, throttles concurrency, advances in dependency order, and can retry only the failed ones; backfill runs are strictly isolated from online scheduling and never pollute success-rate or SLA stats.",
  "点右上「发起补数」,选择要补的任务或工作流。": "Click 'New Backfill' (top right) and pick the task or workflow to backfill.",
  "选日期范围与粒度(按天/周/小时);工作流可勾选「级联下游」按依赖顺序补。": "Choose the date range and granularity (day/week/hour); for workflows, tick 'Cascade downstream' to backfill in dependency order.",
  "设并发上限与实例天花板,点「预览实例」查看将生成多少个补数实例。": "Set the concurrency limit and instance cap, then click 'Preview instances' to see how many will be generated.",
  "点「确认创建」,系统按并发限流逐个以 backfill 触发,进度矩阵实时展示每个(日期×节点)的状态。": "Click 'Create'; instances are triggered as backfill within the concurrency limit, and the progress matrix shows each (date×node) status in real time.",
  "失败时点「续跑失败」只重跑失败项及其下游;也可暂停/恢复/取消整个计划。": "On failure, click 'Retry failed' to re-run only failed items and their downstream; you can also pause/resume/cancel the whole plan.",
  "补数运行一律标记 backfill,不计入在线成功率与 SLA 基线,放心大批量重算。": "Backfill runs are always tagged 'backfill' and excluded from online success rate and SLA baselines — batch-recompute freely.",
  "并发上限与实例天花板是防跑飞的双闸:超过天花板会拒绝创建。": "Concurrency limit and instance cap are dual runaway guards: exceeding the cap rejects creation.",
  "级联补数下,上游节点失败会自动跳过其下游,续跑后自动重新参与。": "In cascade mode, an upstream failure auto-skips its downstream; retrying re-enrolls them automatically.",
  "从历史运行自动学习每个任务的「正常耗时基线」(p50/p90/EWMA),并对配了 SLA 的工作流在运行途中滚动预测完成时刻(ETA);预计会晚于承诺时刻时,在破线之前就告警,给你处置窗口——而不是破线之后才发现。": "Automatically learns each task's normal-duration baseline (p50/p90/EWMA) from history, and rolls forward an ETA for SLA-bound workflows while they run; when the ETA is predicted to miss the committed time, it alerts BEFORE the breach — giving you a window to act, instead of finding out afterward.",
  "先到「动态基线」页点「重新学习基线」,系统从历史运行学出每任务的时长基线(自动排除补数运行)。": "First, on the 'Dynamic baseline' tab, click 'Re-learn baselines'; the system learns each task's duration baseline from history (excluding backfill runs).",
  "在「SLA 定义」页点「新建 SLA」,选一个工作流/任务。": "On the 'SLA definitions' tab, click 'New SLA' and pick a workflow/task.",
  "设承诺完成时刻:相对触发(如触发后 90 分钟)或绝对时刻(如每日 02:00)。": "Set the committed deadline: relative to trigger (e.g. 90 min after) or absolute (e.g. daily 02:00).",
  "设预警提前量(如提前 30 分钟预测到破线就告警)并选通知通道(复用告警中心的通道)。": "Set the warn lead time (e.g. alert when a breach is predicted 30 min ahead) and pick channels (reused from the Alerting Center).",
  "运行途中系统滚动预测:预计破线时经通道推送,并在运维大屏「SLA 风险看板」标红。": "During a run, the system rolls forward the prediction: on a predicted breach it pushes via channels and turns the Ops dashboard 'SLA risk board' red.",
  "基线学习已排除补数(backfill)运行,并用 MAD 去异常,补数大跑不会拉高基线。": "Baseline learning excludes backfill runs and removes outliers with MAD, so heavy backfills never inflate the baseline.",
  "样本不足 7 次的任务标「冷启动」,不触发时长早警,避免新任务误报。": "Tasks with fewer than 7 samples are marked 'cold start' and skip early duration alerts, avoiding false alarms on new tasks.",
  "预测破线做多窗口确认(短窗急、长窗稳),单点抖动不误报;同一次运行只推一次(去重)。": "Breach prediction uses multi-window confirmation (short window reactive, long window stable) so single-point jitter doesn't false-alarm; each run alerts only once (deduped).",
