  "收起": "Collapse",
  "数据建模 = 给杂乱的原始表定一套「规范的仓库结构」,让数据可复用、口径统一。下面 6 个功能是配合使用的一条链:": "Data Modeling = imposing a standardized warehouse structure on messy raw tables so data is reusable with unified definitions. The 6 features below form one chain used together:",
  "给数据分楼层:原始→明细→汇总→应用(ODS/DWD/DWS/ADS)": "Layer the data: raw → detail → summary → application (ODS/DWD/DWS/ADS)",
  "例:广告原始事件放 ODS,清洗后的维度/事实放 DWD": "e.g. raw ad events in ODS, cleaned dimensions/facts in DWD",
  "给数据分业务主题:一个域=一块业务": "Group data by business subject: one domain = one business area",
  "例:广告投放域、玩家行为域": "e.g. Ad-Delivery domain, Player-Behavior domain",
  "核心:建维度表(描述「谁」)+ 事实表(记录「发生了什么」),一键生成并应用到 Redshift": "Core: build dimension tables (describe \"who\") + fact tables (record \"what happened\"), generate & apply DDL to Redshift in one click",
  "例:dim_channel(渠道维)+ fact_ad_daily(广告日事实:曝光/点击/花费)": "e.g. dim_channel (channel dim) + fact_ad_daily (daily ad facts: impressions/clicks/spend)",
  "基于表定义业务指标:原子指标(直接聚合)+ 派生指标(加时间/过滤修饰),口径一处定义处处复用": "Define business metrics on tables: atomic (direct aggregation) + derived (with time/filter modifiers); define once, reuse everywhere",
  "例:总曝光量、总点击量、美国曝光量(派生)": "e.g. total impressions, total clicks, US impressions (derived)",
  "统一字段口径:类型/单位/取值范围,建表时对齐": "Unify field definitions: type/unit/value-range, aligned at table-build time",
  "例:广告花费金额统一 DECIMAL(14,2)、单位 USD": "e.g. ad spend unified as DECIMAL(14,2), unit USD",
  "枚举字典:把编码翻译成含义,可一键落地成 Redshift 维表": "Enum dictionary: translate codes to meanings, one-click land as a Redshift dim table",
  "例:渠道类型 paid=付费渠道 / organic=自然渠道": "e.g. channel type paid=paid channel / organic=organic channel",
  "维度/事实建模": "Dimension / Fact modeling",
  "建好后:事实表 JOIN 维度表就能做分析(如「各广告渠道的点击率 CTR 排名」),指标可被 BI 报表、数据服务、问数直接复用 —— 这就是「建一次、处处用」。": "Once built: JOIN fact with dimension tables for analysis (e.g. \"CTR ranking by ad channel\"); metrics are reusable by BI reports, data services, and Ask-Your-Data — build once, use everywhere.",
  "业务口径": "Business definition",
  "必填:指标名 + 技术口径(表/聚合/度量列)。归属域、单位、业务口径为选填——留空只表示未补充,不影响指标计算与取数。": "Required: metric name + technical spec (table / aggregation / measure column). Owning domain, unit and business definition are optional — leaving them blank only means \"not filled in\" and does not affect metric computation or querying.",
  "业务口径 / 定义(选填,给业务方看的人话说明)": "Business definition (optional, plain-language note for business users)",
  "如:统计广告点击后 7 日内的付费金额,含税": "e.g. paid amount within 7 days after an ad click, tax included",
  "技术口径(聚合@表)": "Technical spec (agg@table)",
  "未填": "Not set",
