  "写 S3 Tables 时,上面「分区配置」里的分区字段必须恰好是这些分区列,并且按原值分区(类型选「字符串」,不能用「日期」)。": "When writing to S3 Tables, the partition fields in “Partition configuration” above must be exactly these partition columns, partitioned by raw value (type “String”, not “Date”).",
  "读到 0 行也允许清空目标表": "Allow clearing the target table even if 0 rows are read",
  "默认情况下,覆盖写入读到 0 行会判为失败、目标表保持不动(防止源端故障时把数据清空)。勾选后,源端确实没有数据时会把目标表(或对应分区)清空。": "By default, an overwrite that reads 0 rows fails and leaves the target table untouched (so a source-side failure cannot wipe the data). If checked, the target table (or the affected partitions) is cleared when the source really has no data.",
