  "镜像**只读、最终一致**:中央按 target 去它自己的 region 拉元数据(AWS 没有跨 region 的全局目录)。每列都常驻最近同步时间;过期就照实说过期,绝不拿旧镜像假装实时。": "The mirror is **read-only and eventually consistent**: the home region pulls metadata per target from that target's own region (AWS has no cross-region global catalog). Every column always shows its last sync time; if stale, it says stale — an old mirror is never passed off as live.",
  "镜像于": "Mirrored at",
  "🔴 「只读 · 来自 <target>」这种跨 target 引用分组本期**没有可挂的东西** —— 跨区复制是只建了数据模型骨架、刻意不实现(SPEC §6.4)。等它落地再挂,不先画一个空分组冒充有这个能力。": "🔴 The 'Read-only · from <target>' cross-target reference group has **nothing to attach** this round — cross-region replication only has its data-model skeleton and is deliberately unimplemented (SPEC §6.4). It will be attached once delivered; no empty group is drawn to pretend the capability exists.",
