  "(端口 9098/9096),请选 VPC + 子网 + 安全组(平台不自动探测可达性;选错则启动后报网络不通,可用 AI 诊断)。安全组须能到达 broker 端口。": " (ports 9098/9096); select a VPC + subnets + security groups (the platform does not probe reachability; a wrong choice shows a network error after start, which AI diagnosis can help with). The security group must reach the broker ports.",
  ":Flink 消费所选 MSK 数据源的 topic;连接(bootstrap)+ 认证(IAM/SCRAM)+ topic 由数据源注入(密钥不入库)。": ": Flink consumes the topic of the selected MSK data source; connection (bootstrap) + authentication (IAM/SCRAM) + topic are injected from the data source (secrets are not stored).",
