  "「自动」先用平台控制面直连,连不上且有 Glue 连接时自动改经 Glue 连接(起一次性 Glue 作业在该连接的子网 / 安全组里登录源库并读表结构,约 1–3 分钟)。源在自有网络、与平台不在同一 VPC 时建议直接选「仅经 Glue 连接」。": "'Auto' first connects directly from the platform control plane; if that fails and a Glue connection exists, it switches to the Glue connection (a one-off Glue job logs in to the source database from the connection's subnet / security group and reads table schemas, about 1–3 minutes). If the source is in its own network and not in the same VPC as the platform, choose 'Glue connection only' directly.",
