  "附加 JDBC 连接参数(可选)": "Extra JDBC connection parameters (optional)",
  "驱动级连接参数,形如 useSSL=false&serverTimezone=Asia/Shanghai&connectTimeout=10000。只作用于经 Glue 连接 / Glue 作业的 JDBC 连接(同步、表发现);控制面直连探测不读它。MySQL 默认已带 zeroDateTimeBehavior=CONVERT_TO_NULL(零值日期 / 时间戳按 NULL 读入,不让整个同步作业失败),填同名参数可覆盖。": "Driver-level connection parameters, e.g. useSSL=false&serverTimezone=Asia/Shanghai&connectTimeout=10000. They apply only to JDBC connections made via the Glue connection / Glue jobs (sync, table discovery); direct probes from the control plane ignore them. MySQL already includes zeroDateTimeBehavior=CONVERT_TO_NULL by default (zero dates / timestamps are read as NULL instead of failing the whole sync job); set the same parameter to override it.",
