  "同步任务跟随数据源的执行环境:在当前区新建数据源后即可建任务、就地执行(源与任务必须同区,跨区取数为设计禁止)": "Sync tasks follow the data source's execution environment: create a data source in the current region, then create tasks that run in place (source and task must be in the same region; cross-region data pulls are prohibited by design)",
